FILE TRANSFERS

A - Read this topic
:A
READ THIS TOPIC

YSEND sends files to your terminal client's YMODEM receiver.
Example: YSEND A0:WELCOME.TXT
Start the matching receive operation in your client when prompted.
For an archive, download the LBR itself and unpack it locally.

UPLOAD FILE.EXT receives one file using XMODEM/CRC.
UPLOAD /Y receives a YMODEM batch into the private review inbox.
Start the matching send operation in your terminal client.
Uploads do not become public files or files in I0:WORK automatically.
The sysop reviews completed submissions before publishing them.

Client transfer commands depend on the terminal program you use.
A failed transfer does not grant access to private system directories.
